+				<LI><p><strong><a id="inflation_adjustment" style="color: black">Inflation Adjustment Factor Calculation</strong></a><br>A gross rent inflation adjustment factor is applied based on a weighted average of a private source gross rent inflation factor and a Consumer Price Index gross rent inflation factor. 
