+Since Myrtle Beach-North Myrtle Beach-Conway, SC HUD Metro FMR Area is covered by at least 3 private data sources, a local-based private rent factor is applied. 
+					
+Furthermore, since Myrtle Beach-North Myrtle Beach-Conway, SC HUD Metro FMR Area is not covered by a local-CPI rent area, a Region-based CPI gross rent factor is applied. </P>
