+			<p><img alt="Map of confirmed tornado touchdowns across the NWS ILM forecast area during Hurricane Florence" src="/images/ilm/climate/Florence/ILMConfirmedTornadoes.jpg" style="width: 785px; height: 592px;" /></p>
