+			<p><strong>Cape Fear River at Elizabethtown, NC</strong></p>
+
+			<p>Crested at 36.44 feet on October 11, 2016, the fourth highest in history.&nbsp; Major flooding occurred in the towns of Clarkton, White Oak, Tar Heel, Bladenboro, as well as in Elizabethtown.&nbsp; Many area roads including state highways were closed due to high water.</p>
+			</td>
