+		<tr>
+			<td style="background-color: rgb(238, 238, 238);">
+			<p><strong>Cape Fear River at downtown Wilmington, NC</strong></p>
+
+			<p>Crested at 8.17 feet on October 8, 2016 during Hurricane Matthew&#39;s storm surge, the highest in history.&nbsp; A second crest of 7.35 feet occurred due to river flooding on October 17, 2016, the fourth highest in history.&nbsp; Water over a foot deep covered Water Street in downtown Wilmington, and even closed a portion of U.S. Highway 421 near the Battleship for a period.</p>
+			</td>
