+<p>&nbsp;</p>
+
+<p>Additionally, the Black River at Kingstree, SC crested at 17.81 feet on October 13th, the second highest in history behind Hurricane Floyd.&nbsp; The Black Creek at Quinby, SC crested at 16.46 feet, the third highest in history.</p>
